OL,3,GNEWSABeer and wine in Wales costs more
OL,4,Aas minimum alcohol price rises by 30%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said the current
OL,7,F50p rate had been made "less effective"
OL,8,Fby inflation, and the change could
OL,9,Fprevent more than 900 deaths across the
OL,10,Fnext two decades.
